				<r3d:description language="eng">MO|RE data is a repository for motor‑performance test data and associated variables.  
It enables sports scientists and related disciplines to upload and download datasets of harmonized, standardized motor‑performance tests.  
Datasets are curated, assigned DOIs, and are made available under various licences and access conditions defined by the data owners.  

MO|RE data is part of the Research Data Center Motor Performance, funded by NFDI4Society – KonsortSWD.  
The repository originated from a DFG project that ran until 2016.</r3d:description>
